<section class="section-band">
    <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Packages</h2>
        <span class="caption">Shipped in the binary flavors</span>
    </div>
    <p>The table below lists packages that ship in the distributed binary flavors. Their licenses are permissive, weak-copyleft, or otherwise accepted under the SCLS binary-distribution policy. GPL-3 linkable libraries are excluded from the public binary flavors.</p>
