            {% endfor %}
            <th scope="col">License</th>
        </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for package in packages %}
        <tr>
            <td class="left">
                {% if package.homepage %}
                <a href="{{ package.homepage }}" class="package-name">{{ package.name }}</a>{% if package.name == 'suitesparse' %}<sup>1</sup>{% endif %}
                {% else %}
                <span class="package-name">{{ package.name }}</span>{% if package.name == 'suitesparse' %}<sup>1</sup>{% endif %}
                {% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="center">{{ package.version }}</td>
            <td class="left">{{ package.summary }}</td>
            {% for flavor in flavors %}
            <td class="center-check">
                {% if package|package_available(flavor.name) %}
                &#10003;
                {% else %}
                -
                {% endif %}
            </td>
            {% endfor %}
            <td class="left">
                {{ license_display.get(package.name, package.license) }}
            </td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    </div>

</section>

<section class="section-band">
    <div class="section-head section-head--accent">
        <h2>Source-Only Packages (GPL-3 / LGPL-3)</h2>
        <span class="caption">Excluded from the binary flavors</span>
    </div>
    <p>The packages below carry GPL-3- or LGPL-3-family licenses and are therefore <em>not</em> included in the public Linux binary flavors. They are primarily for source builds, especially <code>macos</code>, where Xcode and the Command Line Tools do not provide the GNU build-tool chain (autoconf, automake, libtool, m4, bison, and texinfo) or the multiprecision dependencies the scientific stack needs. SCLS also includes a GCC recipe, so the <code>macos</code> flavor can build its own Fortran-capable toolchain from source. Some dependencies, including GMP, MPFR, and MPC, may be consumed as GCC extra sources rather than installed as public Linux binary packages.</p>
    <div class="table-scroll">
    <table class="package-table">
        <thead>
        <tr class="gray-bg">
            <th scope="col">Name</th>
            <th scope="col">Version</th>
            <th scope="col">Description</th>
            <th scope="col">License</th>
        </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for package in gpl3_packages %}
        <tr>
            <td class="left">
                {% if package.homepage %}
                <a href="{{ package.homepage }}" class="package-name">{{ package.name }}</a>
                {% else %}
                <span class="package-name">{{ package.name }}</span>
                {% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="center">{{ package.version }}</td>
            <td class="left">{{ package.summary }}</td>
            <td class="left">{{ license_display.get(package.name, package.license) }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    </div>

</section>

